de a fantastic contained experience while building upon the overarching story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455380/extras/18cb25adb6749deaf8b60eed88df66a4.poster.avif?t=1742258349\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455380/extras/18cb25adb6749deaf8b60eed88df66a4.webm?t=1742258349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455380/extras/18cb25adb6749deaf8b60eed88df66a4.mp4?t=1742258349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455380/extras/a067612e1ebcb2eef2eae4a2ceef2a1f.avif?t=1742258349\" data-has-big width=800 height=1134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455380/extras/3114dfe56241b2829e3893d341b945b8.avif?t=1742258349\" width=800 height=797 /></span></p>",
